            "success grants the exact completion achievement 5873 but does not "
            "grant achievement 5874. Granting 5874 directly from 2670, 2857, "
            "2871, or a generic type-12 hook would overgrant or cross room "
            "boundaries. Achievement 5874 remains mapped-only. Retail "
            "implementation requires a live packet/log or controller decompile "
            "trace of Squirgnasium route activation, participating-party "
            "snapshot and late join/leave handling, qualifying player-death "
