            "finish and interrupt-success ordering, a script-facing reason "
            "signal, count/team/duplicate semantics, completion versus failure/"
            "reset, wipe/replay cleanup, persistence/relogin, 25-point/UI "
            "notification, and full dungeon client smoke."
