            "TargetGroup, or parent. Local Jabbithole objective row 8197 "
            "independently names the same jump-to-avoid-each-Pulverize-ground-"
            "pound condition. The reviewed objective runtime proves only the "
            "explicit fifteen-credit controller boundary: fourteen credits "
            "remain active after 600 seconds, the fifteenth succeeds, and "
            "post-success credit is rejected. DataMapping maps Bubbles to "
            "Creature2 62010, but it has action-set 0 and no reviewed runtime "
            "spawn. Pulverize spells 72140/72142 proxy Challenge Signal 75104; "
            "separate Challenge Signal - Success spell 75106 carries Ravel "
            "mode 4 / signal 25160 / DataBits02 1, but the direct Pulverize "
            "chain does not reference 75106. Runtime dispatches only Ravel "
            "mode 1, and IWorldEntityScript.OnSignal would discard the payload "
            "bit even if unsupported mode 4/5 dispatch were guessed. Static "
            "evidence therefore does not prove an airborne/contact test or "
            "success producer. The current Ultimate Protogames controller does "
            "not select or activate the Squirgnasium route, spawn Bubbles, "
            "bind or observe Pulverize, receive the Ravel payload, credit "
            "objective 3200, or own failure/reset cleanup. Because objective "
