            "explicit id to eligible current online objective-team members if "
            "that objective succeeds, while failed 3200 and successful sibling "
            "3198 do not grant it. Focused positive and negative tests pin the "
            "exact grant boundary, dedupe, and offline behavior, but the "
            "boundary is currently unreachable in the reviewed route. "
            "Crediting every Pulverize cast without proving an avoid or "
            "dispatching unsupported Ravel modes while dropping their payload "
            "would invent semantics. The achievement grant boundary is "
            "implemented; the qualifying Bubbles/Pulverize avoid producer "
            "remains mapped-only. Retail completion requires a live packet/log "
            "or controller/spell decompile trace of room and objective "
