            "optionals 2952/2953/2957. None proves per-member participation, "
            "the party snapshot boundary, or whether one kick may qualify "
            "multiple players. Focused negative tests prove successful "
            "aggregate room objective 2677 and successful ten-knockoff "
            "objective 2923 do not grant achievement 5892. Granting on either "
