            "Build 16042 Achievement 5895, 'Immortal: Elemental Hospital', is "
            "a type-12, category-316, WorldZone-4330, required-progress-1 "
            "character achievement worth 50 points. Its completion-percentage "
            "display is 0, while its object and alternate object ids are both "
            "0. Title, description, and progress text ids 654414/654415/"
            "666977 require completing the Elemental Hospital event without "
            "anyone in the party dying. AchievementChecklist row 5895 is "
            "unrelated: it belongs to achievement 4315 bit 1 and object 33229, "
