            "deathless holder would invent semantics. Ultimate Protogames has "
            "generic no-deaths objectives 2857 and 2871, but the current "
            "controller explicitly owns them for the Prototentiary and Waste "
            "Management Facility respectively. Reusing either objective or "
            "granting 5895 whenever objective 2674 succeeds would cross room "
            "boundaries or overgrant successful runs with party deaths. The "
            "current PublicEventPhase catalog has no Elemental Hospital phase, "
            "and UltimateProtogamesEventScript has no room-scoped Elemental "
            "Hospital activation, active-attempt flag, joined-party death "
            "state, completion callback, reset, or achievement-5895 grant "
            "producer. Focused negative coverage proves exact objective-2674 "
            "success grants base Master of the Elements achievement 5894 but "
            "does not grant Immortal: Elemental Hospital without no-deaths "
            "evidence. Achievement 5895 remains mapped-only. Retail "
