            "and a 25-point value. Title, description, and progress text ids "
            "655845/655846/666982 require completing the Toxophobia optional "
            "objective by never breathing toxic air. AchievementChecklist row "
            "5900 is unrelated: it belongs to achievement 4331 bit 0 and object "
            "4330, while no checklist row has achievementId or objectId 5900. "
            "Jabbithole achievement row 2022 independently maps the same "
            "achievement id, title, condition, required count 1, 25-point "
            "value, and WorldZone 4330. Build objective 2892 is the exact "
            "public-team flags-4 Script challenge at WorldLocation2 41714 with "
            "count 0, object 0, no failure timer, and challenge category 1. "
            "Its text requires completing the event without breathing toxic "
            "air; Jabbithole objective row 8146 independently maps the same "
            "condition. UltimateProtogamesEventScript now grants achievement "
            "5900 by explicit id to current online objective-team members when "
            "exact objective 2892 succeeds, skipping offline and already-"
            "completed members. Focused tests pin the positive team grant, "
            "completed and offline rejection, failed-2892 rejection, and "
            "successful sibling-2891 rejection. This implements the evidence-"
            "backed achievement grant boundary without inventing the toxic-air "
            "failure or event-completion producer. Adjacent achievement 5904 "
            "is a distinct 20-second toxic-air survival condition. Spell 72234 "
            "encodes toxic-air damage plus receiver mode 4 / signal 23106, and "
            "Protective Shield spells suspend hazard 214, but the conservative "
            "RavelSignal boundary keeps mode 4 diagnostics-only. The current "
            "controller has no Elemental Hospital phase, does not activate "
            "objective 2674 or 2892, enable hazard 214, apply or drop beacon "
            "protection, receive signal 23106, or own terminal event success. "
            "Objective 2892 remains a mapped-only producer. Retail completion "
            "still requires route and objective activation, toxic-air and "
            "beacon lifecycle, exact failure semantics and party scope, event-"
