            "62274, 62305, 62308-62311, 62453, and 62560-62563. Spells 72003 "
            "and 72310-72313 state that the carrier receives movement speed and "
            "toxic-air protection and can change beacon attunement, but static "
            "rows do not prove pickup/drop/transfer ownership, how carry "
