            "whose sole member is Creature2 62987 '[UP] e2678 - Sneaky Prison "
            "- Gate Console'. UltimateProtogamesEventScript activates 2857 only "
            "for the Prototentiary route, tracks its own Prototentiary player-"
            "death state, and grants Immortal Prototentiary 5906 on success. "
            "No-death objective 2871 is separately anchored to tank-room "
            "WorldLocation2 41754; the script tracks tank-room player deaths "
            "and grants Immortal Waste Management Facility 5865 from that row. "
            "Granting achievement 5934 from either shared objective, from crate "
            "objective 2673 alone, or from timed Spring Cleaning 2921 would "
            "cross-credit unrelated rooms or invent missing death semantics. "
            "The current controller also does not select the Lost and Found "
            "route or maintain a Lost and Found party-death state. Focused "
            "regressions prove that successful objectives 2673, 2921, 2857, and "
